 Difficulty</b> – Enemies get stronger as you advance.<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">🧠</span>\n     <b>Strategic Gameplay</b> – Plan your moves and manage survival resources.<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">📱</span>\n     <b>Cross-Platform Ready</b> – Export to Android & iOS with ease.<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">⚡</span>\n     <b>Optimized Performance</b> – Runs smoothly on both high and low-end\n     devices.<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">🔄</span>\n     <b>Customizable Template</b> – Replace characters, maps, and UI for your\n     own war game.<p></p></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\"><br /></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">💡</span> Why Choose This Code?</b></p><p><b></b></p><b></b>\n\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">🚀</span>\n     Ready-to-publish <b>Unity war survival source code</b><p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">🎨</span>\n     Fully reskin-friendly with customizable assets<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">📖</span>\n     Beginner-friendly documentation included<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Symbol\', sans-serif;\">🕹</span>\n     Clean coding structure for easy editing<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">🏆</span>\n     Popular <b>battle survival genre</b> with huge player demand<p></p></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span 