(38, 1, 1, 1, 7, 'Level Up and Build Your Fast Food Empire', NULL, NULL, 'level-up-and-build-your-fast-food-empire-06826', 18.00000000, 59.00000000, 120.00000000, '68e39ae11d40a1759746785.jpg', 1, 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KQROEodz_0PwZMJRrdfNtsplKXV1aQQL/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AIcZ3BecyuQ', '[]', '68e39ae127e561759746785.jpg', '68e39ae12eed91759746785.jpg', 8, 3, 4.67, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18pt;\"><b>Level Up and Build Your Food\nEmpire </b><b><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">🚀👑</span> </b>is a fun and addictive <b>restaurant\nmanagement and cooking simulation game</b> where players serve customers,\nprepare delicious meals, and grow their fast-food empire. With engaging\ngameplay, colorful visuals, and endless customization options, this template is\nperfect for developers looking to publish their own fast-food simulation game.<b></b></p><p><b></b></p><b></b><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18pt;\"><br /></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">⭐</span> Key Features</b></p><p><b></b></p><b></b>\n\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">🍔</span>\n     <b>Restaurant Management Gameplay</b> – Take orders, cook meals, and serve\n     hungry customers.<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">🎮</span>\n     <b>Easy-to-Play Controls</b> – Simple tap mechanics for quick cooking and\n     serving.<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">🎨</span>\n     <b>Colorful Graphics & Smooth Animations</b> – Attractive visuals for\n     an exciting fast-food experience.<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Symbol\', sans-serif;\">⏱</span>\n     <b>Time Management Challenges</b> – Deliver orde