goe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">🏆</span>\n     Popular <b>cooking & restaurant simulation genre</b> loved worldwide<p></p></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\"><br /></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">💻</span> Requirements</b></p><p><b></b></p><b></b>\n\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Unity\n     Version: <b>6 or newer</b><p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Basic\n     knowledge of Unity editor<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Android/iOS\n     SDK for exporting builds<p></p></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\"><br /></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">📖</span> Instructions</b></p><p><b></b></p><b></b>\n\n<ol style=\"margin-top:0cm;\" start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Install\n     <b>Unity version 6 or newer</b><p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Import\n     the provided project code<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Customize\n     food, menus, and UI<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Build\n     & publish on Play Store / App Store<p></p></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br /></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">If you require any further information, feel free to contact\nus:<br />\n<span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">📧</span>\n<b>support@readygamecode.com</b></p>', NULL, 0, 0, 0, '[\"Unity Restaurant Game\",\"Fast Food Universe Unity Code\",\"Cooking Simulation Template\",\"Food Serving Unity Game\",\"Ready-to-Publish Unity Source\",\"unity game source code\",\"unity source code\",\"cheapest game code\",\"maxima gaming studio\"]', 1, '68e39ae118a7e1759746785.zip', NULL, NULL, 0, '2025-10-06 11:17:28', NULL, '2025-10-06 10:33:05', '2025-11-15 03:18:05', 25.00000000, 50.00000000),
(39, 1, 1, 1, 7, 'Tank Strike 3D – Survival War Game', NULL, NULL, 'tank-strike-3d-survival-war-game-80606', 13.00000000, 59.00000000, 120.00000000, '68e39bf2d5c4a1759747058.jpg', 1, 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/13ZtjaYF0HXBXrvlBZxJKEBYs03jg5eEI/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uXdgcpM71p8', '[]', '68e39bf2d72621759747058.jpg', '68e39bf2dcea21759747058.jpg', 10, 2, 4.00, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Tank Strike 3D – Army Battle & Survival War Game </b>is\na thrilling <b>arcade tank shooting game</b> where players control a tank,\ndodge enemy fire, and destroy obstacles to survive. With fast-paced gameplay,\nexplosive effects, and smooth controls, this template is perfect for developers\nlooking to publish their own action-packed tank shooter game.</p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br /></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">⭐</span> Key Features</b></p><p><b></b></p><b></b>\n\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Symbol\', sans-serif;\">🕹</span>\n     <b>Arcade Tank Shooting Gameplay</b> – Destroy enemies, dodge bullets, and\n     survive waves.<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">🎮</span>\n     <b>Easy-to-Play Controls</b> – Smooth joystick/tap mechanics for all\n     players.<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">💥</span>\n     <b>Explosive Battles</b> – Shoot through obstacles and defeat enemy tanks.<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">🎨</span>\n     <b>Dynamic Graphics & Animations</b> – Action-packed visuals with\n     smooth performance.<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">📈</span>\n     <b>Level Progression System</b> – Unlock harder levels and challenges.<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">🔊</span>\n     <b>Immersive Sound Effects</b> – Enhance the arcade battle experience.<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">📱</span>\n     <b>Cross-Platform Ready</b> – Works seamlessly on Android & iOS.<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">⚡</span>\n     <b>Optimized Performance</b> – Runs smoothly on both low and high-end\n     devices.<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">🔄</span>\n     <b>Customizable Template</b> – Replace tanks, maps, and UI to create your\n     own arcade shooter.<p></p></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\"><br /></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">💡</span> Why Choose This Code?</b></p><p><b></b></p><b></b>\n\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">🚀</span>\n     Ready-to-publish <b>Unity tank shooting source code</b><p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">🎨</span>\n     Fully reskin-friendly with customizable assets<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">📖</span>\n     Beginner-friendly documentation included<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Symbol\', sans-serif;\">🕹</span>\n     Clean coding structure for easy editing<p></p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\">🏆</span>\n     Popular <b>arcade shooter genre</b> with strong player engagement<p></p></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\'Segoe UI Emoji\', sans-serif;\"><br />