(43, 1, 1, 1, 7, 'Bird Down – Unity Game Source Code', NULL, NULL, 'bird-down-unity-game-source-code-44883', 9.00000000, 60.00000000, 120.00000000, '68f1d20119ca81760678401.jpg', 1, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15VWNhr6Ibwp7eIpyDBvGuZg5Z2NaZbWg?usp=drive_link', 'https://youtu.be/oxEpV6XgbLQ', '[]', '68f1d2011c2bc1760678401.jpg', '68f1d2012fb491760678401.jpg', 13, 2, 5.00, '<p><strong>Bird Down – Unity Game Source Code</strong> is a complete 2D arcade project built with Unity, where players control a funny little bird jumping between floating platforms. </p><p> Your mission is simple — <strong>stay in the air, dodge the spikes, and collect points!</strong> </p><p><br /></p><p>With its easy mechanics and addictive gameplay, Bird Down is perfect for all age groups and a guaranteed hit for your next mobile release. </p><p><br /></p><p>🎬 Watch Gameplay Video: </p><p> 👉 Watch on YouTube <em>(replace with your gameplay video link)</em> </p><p><br /></p><p> </p><p><br /></p><p><strong>🌟 Game Highlights</strong> </p><p><br /></p><ul><li>🕊️ <strong>Addictive Jump & Dodge Gameplay</strong> – Keep the bird alive by landing safely on platforms. </li><li>⚡ <strong>Fast-Paced Arcade Fun</strong> – Perfect balance of challenge and excitement. </li><li>🎨 <strong>Colorful 2D Graphics</strong> – Beautiful cartoon-style backgrounds and animations. </li><li>🧠 <strong>Simple Controls</strong> – Tap or swipe to move and stay alive. </li><li>📈 <strong>Point System</strong> – Earn points as you climb higher. </li><li>💥 <strong>Dynamic Obstacles</strong> – Randomized platforms and spike traps for endless replayability. </li><li>📱 <strong>Cross-Platform Ready</strong> – Optimized for both Android & iOS devices. </li><li>🔄 <strong>Fully Customizable</strong> – Replace bird, backgrounds, sounds, and UI in minutes. </li></ul><p> </p><p><br /></p><p><strong>💡 Why Buy This Source Code?</strong> </p><p><br /></p><p>✅ Complete ready-to-publish project </p><p> ✅ Lightweight, smooth performance </p><p> ✅ Reskin-friendly structure </p><p> ✅ Perfect for hyper-casual and arcade game stores </p><p> ✅ Play Store and App Store compatible </p><p><br /></p><p> </p><p><br /></p><p><strong>🧰 What’s Included</strong> </p><p><br /></p><ul><li>Full Unity Project Folder </li><li>C# Source Code (Well-Commented) </li><li>Assets (Sprites, UI, Audio) </li><li>Documentation (Setup + Build Guide) </li><li>Support & Lifetime Updates </li></ul><p> </p><p><br /></p><p><strong>⚙️ Requirements</strong> </p><p><br /></p><ul><li>Unity Version: <strong>6 or newer</strong> </li><li>Android/iOS SDK </li><li>Basic Unity knowledge </li></ul><p> </p><p><br /></p><p><strong>🚀 How to Publish</strong> </p><p><br /></p><p>1️⃣ Open the project in Unity </p><p> 2️⃣ Replace assets and branding </p><p> 3️⃣ Build for Android or iOS </p><p> 4️⃣ Publish on Play Store or App Store </p><p><br /></p><p> </p><p><br /></p><p><strong>📞 Contact & Support</strong> </p><p><br /></p><p>📱 WhatsApp: +91 9408212310 </p><p> 📧 Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@readygamecode.com\" style=\"color:rgb(70,120,134);\">support@readygamecode.com</a> </p><p> 🌐 Website: <a href=\"https://readygamecode.com/\" style=\"color:rgb(70,120,134);\">https://readygamecode.com</a> </p><p> 📸 Instagram: @readygamecode </p><p><br /></p><p> </p>', NULL, 0, 0, 0, '[\"unity bird game source code\",\"buy unity arcade project\",\"unity 2d game full project\",\"ready to publish unity source code\",\"flappy bird style unity game\",\"unity platform jumper\",\"ready game code\"]', 1, '68f1d201161aa1760678401.zip', NULL, NULL, 0, '2025-10-24 03:13:25', NULL, '2025-10-17 05:20:01', '2026-06-19 07:22:53', 25.00000000, 50.00000000),
