ect balance between relaxation and challenge, making it easy to play anytime and anywhere.</p><p><br /></p><p>👉 Test your brainpower and enjoy hours of puzzle-solving fun.</p><p><br /></p><h2>🎯 Why Players Love DotConnect</h2><p>DotConnect combines simple gameplay mechanics with engaging puzzle challenges. Each level encourages strategic thinking while maintaining a relaxing and enjoyable atmosphere, making it a great choice for puzzle game fans.</p><p><br /></p><h2>💻 Requirements</h2><p>Unity Version: 2022 or above</p><p>Basic knowledge of the Unity Editor is recommended for customization and project management.</p><p><br /></p><h2>📖 Instructions</h2><p>Getting started is quick and simple. Open the project using the supported Unity version and explore the game structure, levels, and assets.</p><p>You can customize gameplay elements, visuals, UI components, and other assets to match your own branding or puzzle game concept before publishing.</p><p><br /></p><h2>📞 Support</h2><p>If you require any further information, feel free to contact Us.</p><p>📧 <a href=\"mailto:info@readygamecode.com\">info@readygamecode.com</a></p>', NULL, 0, 0, 0, '[\"DotConnect\",\"PuzzleGame\",\"LinePuzzle\",\"BrainGames\",\"UnityGame\",\"CasualGames\",\"AddictivePuzzle\",\"MobileGaming\",\"UnityDevelopment\",\"TrendingGames2025\",\"ReadyGameCode\"]', 1, '6a33d68f6be711781782159.zip', NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-06-19 07:10:02', NULL, '2026-06-18 11:29:20', '2026-06-19 07:10:02', 25.00000000, 50.00000000),
