core System</h3><p>Chain multiple fruits for bonus points.</p><p>Create impressive combos and challenge players to beat their highest scores.</p><p><br /></p><h3>🎨 HD Visuals & Realistic Physics</h3><p>Smooth slicing animation and juicy effects.</p><p>Colorful graphics and realistic fruit-splitting effects create a satisfying arcade experience.</p><p><br /></p><h3>🔊 Dynamic Sound Effects</h3><p>Realistic slicing and explosion audio for extra immersion.</p><p>High-quality sound effects enhance every action and make gameplay more engaging.</p><p><br /></p><h3>🕹️ Classic & Arcade Modes</h3><p>Different game modes for endless fun.</p><p>Offer players multiple ways to enjoy the game and improve replay value.</p><p><br /></p><h3>📱 Cross-Platform Ready</h3><p>Optimized for Android and iOS builds.</p><p>Launch your game across multiple mobile platforms with ease.</p><p><br /></p><h3>⚙️ Easy Customization</h3><p>Change fruit sprites, effects, and UI easily.</p><p>Customize the project to fit your own branding, visual style, and gameplay preferences.</p><p><br /></p><h2>💡 Why Buy This Source Code?</h2><p>Fruit-slicing games remain one of the most popular arcade genres thanks to their simple controls and highly addictive gameplay. This project is ideal for developers looking for a polished game that can be customized and published quickly.</p><p>✅ 100% ready-to-publish Unity game</p><p>✅ Best-selling arcade genre</p><p>✅ Simple, addictive, and replayable gameplay</p><p>✅ Perfect for reskinning and rebranding</p><p>✅ Lightweight and bug-free performance</p><p><br /></p><h2>🧰 What’s Included</h2><p>Everything required to customize and publish the game is included in the package.</p><ul><li>Full Unity Project Folder</li><li>C# Source Code</li><li>Fruits, bombs, and UI assets</li><li>Particle and sound effects</li><li>Documentation (Setup + Build Guide)</li><li>Lifetime Developer Support</li><li><br /></li></ul><h2>⚙️ Requirements</h2><p>Unity Version: 6 or newer</p><p>Android/iOS