(100, 1, 1, 1, 7, 'Advanced Platformer | Unity Game Code', NULL, 'Advanced Platformer Unity source code with engaging platform challenges, responsive controls, and full project files for quick deployment.', 'advanced-platformer-unity-game-code', 25.00000000, 60.00000000, 120.00000000, '6a34c509534f71781843209.png', 1, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15VWNhr6Ibwp7eIpyDBvGuZg5Z2NaZbWg?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4UA5ZYHfsow', '[]', '6a34c509565811781843209.jpg', '6a34c5096aaba1781843209.jpg', 0, 0, 0.00, '<h1>Jump, Climb, and Conquer Every Challenge</h1><p>Advanced Platformer – Unity Game Source Code is a 2D Adventure Game with smooth animations, interactive environments, and realistic physics.</p><p>Players control a skilled ninja-like character who must jump, climb, and navigate through challenging obstacles to reach the goal.</p><p>Built with Unity 6, this project combines classic platformer mechanics with modern control systems — perfect for mobile and desktop publishing.</p><p>Whether you\'re creating an action-adventure game, a platformer challenge, or a ninja-themed experience, this project provides a solid foundation with optimized gameplay systems and responsive controls.</p><p><br /></p><h2>🎬 Watch Gameplay Video</h2><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/4UA5ZYHfsow\">https://youtu.be/4UA5ZYHfsow</a></p><p><br /></p><h2>🕹️ Game Highlights</h2><p><br /></p><h3>🧗 Climbable Ladders</h3><p>Dynamic ladder system for smooth vertical movement.</p><p>Allows players to navigate levels naturally while adding more variety to platforming challenges.</p><p><br /></p><h3>🦘 Realistic Jump Physics</h3><p>Balanced jump height and gravity for engaging control.</p><p>Carefully tuned movement mechanics provide responsive and enjoyable gameplay.</p><p><br /></p><h3>🧱 Interactive Platforms</h3><p>Move, jump, and balance through multiple obstacles.</p><p>Platform layouts encourage exploration, timing, and skill-based progression.</p><p><br /></p><h3>☁️ 2D Parallax Environment</h3><p>Adds depth and realism to the sky background.</p><p>Layered visual effects create a more immersive platforming experience.</p><p><br /></p><h3>🎮 Keyboard & Touch Controls</h3><p>Works seamlessly on both PC and mobile devices.</p><p>Flexible control systems ensure smooth gameplay across different platforms.</p><p><br /></p><h3>🧭 Level System</h3><p>Easy to expand with custom maps or challenges.</p><p>Developers can quickly create new stages and gameplay experiences.</p><p><br /></p><h3>📱 Fully Mobile Optimized</h3><p>Perfect frame rate and input response.</p><p>Designed to deliver smooth performance on a wide range of mobile devices.</p><p><br /></p><h2>💡 Why Buy This Source Code?</h2><p>This project is built with flexibility and performance in mind, making it an excellent choice for developers who want to create their own platformer or adventure game without starting from scratch.</p><p>✅ Full Unity source code with clean C# scripts</p><p>✅ Modular character controller (jump, climb, fall detection)</p><p>✅ Easy to customize levels and assets</p><p>✅ AdMob ready for monetization</p><p>✅ Lightweight and mobile-friendly</p><p>✅ Ideal for platformer, adventure, or ninja-style projects</p><p><br /></p><h2>🧰 What’s Included</h2><p>Everything needed to customize, build, and publish your game is included.</p><ul><li>Complete Unity project folder</li><li>Character controller with physics</li><li>Sample levels & prefabs</li><li>Documentation + setup guide</li><li>Free lifetime support</li><li><br /></li></ul><h2>⚙️ Requirements</h2><p>Unity 6 or newer</p><p>Windows</p><p>Basic Unity experience</p><p><br /></p><h2>🚀 How to Publish</h2><p>Getting started is simple and beginner-friendly. Open the project in Unity and explore the included levels, gameplay systems, and assets.</p><p>Replace character, platforms, or backgrounds to create your own unique platformer experience. You can also integrate your preferred monetization strategy using AdMob or Unity Ads.</p><p>Once customization is complete, build the project for Android or iOS and upload it to Google Play or the App Store.</p><p><br /></p><h2>📞 Contact & Support</h2><p>📱 WhatsApp: +91 9408212310</p><p>📧 Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@readygamecode.com\">support@readygamecode.com</a></p><p>🌐 Website: <a href=\"https://readygamecode.com/\">https://readygamecode.com</a></p><p>📸 Instagram: @readygamecode</p>', NULL, 0, 0, 0, '[\"unity platformer game source code\",\"unity 2d side scroller\",\"unity ninja adventure\",\"ladder climbing unity project\",\"2d physics platform game unity\"]', 1, '6a34c5094ea001781843209.zip', NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-06-19 07:05:52', NULL, '2026-06-19 04:26:49', '2026-06-19 07:26:42', 25.00000000, 50.00000000),
(101, 1, 1, 1, 7, 'Bird Down 2D – Arcade Unity Game', NULL, 'Download a ready-to-launch flying arcade game with Bird Down Unity source code, AdMob integration, and mobile support for Android & iOS.', 'bird-down-2d-arcade-unity-game', 9.00000000, 59.00000000, 120.00000000, '6a34c8a43704b1781844132.png', 1, 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zzGV8Ypzr0cpkf0X91o9Qo4KXmZEJLXZ/view?usp=sharing', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oxEpV6XgbLQ', '[]', '6a34c8a43aba31781844132.jpg', '6a34c8a4555e31781844132.jpg', 0, 0, 0.00, '<h1>Help the Little Bird Soar Higher and Survive the Challenge</h1><p><br /></p><p>Bird Down – Unity Game Source Code is a complete 2D arcade project built with Unity, where players control a funny little bird jumping between floating platforms.</p><p>Your mission is simple — stay in the air, dodge the spikes, and collect points!</p><p>With its easy mechanics and addictive gameplay, Bird Down is perfect for all age groups and a guaranteed hit for your next mobile release.</p><p>Designed for quick play sessions and endless replayability, this project delivers the perfect combination of casual fun, fast reactions, and rewarding progression. Whether players are trying to beat their personal best or challenge friends for a higher score, Bird Down keeps them coming back for another run.</p><h2><br /></h2><h2>🚀 What Makes Bird Down Fun?</h2><p><br /></p><p>🕊️ <strong>Addictive Jump & Dodge Gameplay</strong> – Keep the bird alive by landing safely on platforms.</p><p>Every jump matters. Players must carefully time their movements while avoiding dangerous obstacles and staying airborne for as long as possible.</p><p><br /></p><p>⚡ <strong>Fast-Paced Arcade Fun</strong> – Perfect balance of challenge and excitement.</p><p>The simple gameplay loop is easy to learn but difficult to master, making every session exciting.</p><p><br /></p><p>🎨 <strong>Colorful 2D Graphics</strong> – Beautiful cartoon-style backgrounds and animations.</p><p>Bright visuals and smooth animations create an enjoyable experience suitable for players of all ages.</p><p><br /></p><p>🧠 <strong>Simple Controls</strong> – Tap or swipe to move and stay alive.</p><p>Easy controls allow players to jump right into the action without any learning curve.</p><p><br /></p><p>📈 <strong>Point System</strong> – Earn points as you climb higher.</p><p>Challenge yourself to beat previous records and compete for the highest score.</p><p><br /></p><p>💥 <strong>Dynamic Obstacles</strong> – Randomized platforms and spike traps for endless replayability.</p><p>Each run feels different, encouraging players to keep playing and improving.</p><p><br /></p><p>📱 <strong>Cross-Platform Ready</strong> – Optimized for both Android & iOS devices.</p><p>Launch your game on multiple platforms with smooth and responsive performance.</p><p><br /></p><p>🔄 <strong>Fully Customizable</strong> – Replace bird, backgrounds, sounds, and UI in minutes.</p><p>Quickly customize the game to match your own brand, art style, or publishing strategy.</p><p><br /></p><h2>🎯 Perfect For</h2><p>Bird Down is an excellent choice for developers looking to enter the hyper-casual or arcade gaming market. Its simple mechanics, lightweight structure, and broad audience appeal make it ideal for rapid publishing and reskin projects.</p><p><br /></p><h2>💡 Why Buy This Source Code?</h2><ul><li>Complete ready-to-publish project</li><li>Lightweight, smooth performance</li><li>Reskin-friendly structure</li><li>Perfect for hyper-casual and arcade game stores</li><li>Play Store and App Store compatible</li></ul><p><br /></p><h2>📦 Package Contents</h2><p>Everything needed to customize and publish the game is included:</p><ul><li>Full Unity Project Folder</li><li>C# Source Code (Well-Commented)</li><li>Assets (Sprites, UI, Audio)</li><li>Documentation (Setup + Build Guide)</li><li>Support & Lifetime Updates</li><li><br /></li></ul><h2>⚙️ Requirements</h2><p>Unity Version: 6 or newer</p><p>Android/iOS SDK</p><p>Basic Unity kno