(110, 1, 0, 1, 8, 'UNO Underwater – Unity Game Code', NULL, 'Create an underwater card adventure with a Unity ready-made template inspired by classic UNO gameplay and strategic card matching.', 'uno-underwater-unity-game-code', 20.00000000, 59.00000000, 120.00000000, '6a34e273157921781850739.png', NULL, 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oD9x9X4uESzGZzSI66g339bcii8wm8sX/view?usp=sharing', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f8m2CDI2mPY', '[]', '6a34e2731a03e1781850739.jpg', '6a34e2732f3851781850739.jpg', 0, 0, 0.00, '<h1>Experience Competitive Card Battles Beneath the Ocean</h1><p>UNO Underwater – Unity Game Source Code is an exciting underwater-themed card game inspired by classic UNO gameplay!</p><p>Play against the computer or real players online, match colors and numbers, use action cards wisely, and be the first to say “UNO!” to win the round!</p><p>With beautiful ocean visuals, multiplayer mode, and smooth animations, this project is fully optimized for both Android & iOS.</p><p>Designed for both casual and competitive players, UNO Underwater combines familiar card mechanics with a refreshing underwater presentation. Whether playing against AI opponents or challenging real players online, every match creates new opportunities for strategy and exciting comebacks.</p><p><br /></p><h2>Watch Gameplay Video</h2><p>Watch on YouTube:</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f8m2CDI2mPY\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f8m2CDI2mPY</a></p><p><br /></p><h2>Gameplay Overview</h2><p>The game revolves around matching cards, managing special abilities, and carefully planning each move. Players must pay attention to their remaining cards, react to changing situations, and use action cards strategically to gain an advantage.</p><p>Online multiplayer and AI modes provide multiple ways to enjoy the game, helping increase replayability and long-term player engagement.</p><p><br /></p><h2>Main Features</h2><ul><li>Underwater Theme – Play classic UNO in a stunning ocean world.</li><li>Smart AI Opponents – Challenge intelligent bots in single-player mode.</li><li>Online Multiplayer Mode – Play with friends or random global players.</li><li>UNO Call System – Tap UNO before your last card to avoid penalties.</li><li>Action Cards – Skip, Reverse, Draw 2, and Wild cards included.</li><li>Modern UI & Smooth Animations – Clean interface for better engagement.</li><li>Sound & Music Control – Toggle background sound anytime.</li><li>Fully Optimized for Mobile – Works perfectly on all screen sizes.</li><li><br /></li></ul><h2>Development Advantages</h2><p>This project includes both multiplayer and single-player gameplay systems, making it suitable for developers who want to enter the card game category without building complex systems from scratch.</p><p>The structure is organized and easy to customize, allowing developers to modify themes, card designs, visual assets, and game rules according to their publishing requirements.</p><p><br /></p><h3>Included Benefits</h3><ul><li>Full multiplayer + AI modes</li><li>Clean and well-documented Unity project</li><li>Ready to publish on Play Store & App Store</li><li>Supports Photon or Mirror networking</li><li>AdMob integration ready</li><li>Great for card & strategy game category</li><li><br /></li></ul><h2>Package Contents</h2><ul><li>Complete Unity project folder</li><li>Multiplayer scripts (Photon-ready)</li><li>Game assets (cards, UI, icons)</li><li>Documentation + setup guide</li><li>Developer support</li><li><br /></li></ul><h2>Requirements</h2><ul><li>Unity 6 or newer</li><li>Android/iOS SDK</li><li>Photon account (for online multiplayer)</li><li><br /></li></ul><h2>Getting Started</h2><p>Open the project in Unity and review the included gameplay systems, networking setup, and card assets.</p><p>Customize the game name, logo, visual theme, and card designs to match your branding. Additional monetization features such as AdMob or Unity Ads can also be integrated before release.</p><p>Once testing is complete, export the project for Android or iOS and publish it on the Play Store or App Store.</p><p><br /></p><h2>Contact & Support</h2><p>WhatsApp: +91 9408212310</p><p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@readygamecode.com\">support@readygamecode.com</a></p><p>Website: <a href=\"https://readygamecode.com/\">https://readygamecode.com</a></p><p>Instagram: @readygamecode</p>', NULL, 0, 0, 0, '[\"uno unity source code\",\"multiplayer card game unity\",\"underwater uno clone unity\",\"uno card game template\",\"unity photon multiplayer card game\",\"unity uno android project\"]', 0, NULL, '6a34e2730eefc1781850739.zip', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-19 06:32:19', '2026-06-19 06:32:19', 25.00000000, 50.00000000),
