Enemies – Soldiers, turrets, and more make every level unique.</li><li>Health Bar System – Real-time player HP display for combat immersion.</li><li>Epic Sound FX – Explosions, firing, and alert sounds enhance the war atmosphere.</li><li>Mobile Ready – Fully optimized for Android and iOS builds.</li></ul><p><br /></p><h2>Inspired by Classic Arcade Shooters</h2><p><br /></p><p>The project captures the feel of traditional run-and-gun games while introducing modern mobile-friendly controls and performance optimizations.</p><p>Developers can easily expand the experience with new weapons, enemy types, environments, bosses, missions, and progression systems.</p><p><br /></p><h2>Why Developers Like This Project</h2><p><br /></p><ul><li>100% complete Unity project</li><li>Fully mobile-optimized controls</li><li>Easy reskin and customization</li><li>Ideal for war, shooter, or action categories</li><li>AdMob / Unity Ads integration ready</li><li>Great performance across devices</li><li><br /></li></ul><h2>Development Package</h2><p><br /></p><ul><li>Full Unity project</li><li>Complete C# source code</li><li>Sprites, backgrounds, UI elements</li><li>Documentation + setup instructions</li><li>Developer support</li><li><br /></li></ul><h2>Requirements</h2><p><br /></p><ul><li>Unity 6 or newer</li><li>Android / iOS SDK</li><li>Basic Unity knowledge</li><li><br /></li></ul><h2>Prepare for Launch</h2><p><br /></p><p>Open the project in Unity and review the included gameplay systems, combat mechanics, enemies, and visual assets.</p><p>Replace logos, name, and assets to match your own branding. AdMob IDs can also be integrated before release if monetization is planned.</p><p>After testing and optimization, build for Android or iOS and publish on the Play Store or App Store.</p><p><br /></p><h2>Contact & Support</h2><p>WhatsApp: +91 9408212310</p><p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@readygamecode.com\">support@readygamecode.com</a></p><p>Website: <a href=\"https://readygamecode.com/\">h