(123, 1, 0, 1, 9, 'Shooty Clock - Easy Unity Source Code for Players', NULL, 'Play Shooty Clock with this fun unity game source code: easy shooting, clock timer, exciting levels. Perfect code for players who love quick arcade action.', 'shooty-clock-easy-unity-source-code-for-players', 14.00000000, 59.00000000, 120.00000000, '6a35187de13121781864573.jpg', NULL, 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YVZ_1Jywpe7oACtzR9DY-SLPi91D8DRv/view?usp=sharing', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ifal4YvGROg', '[]', '6a35187de3aaa1781864573.jpg', '6a35187e0d9f01781864574.jpg', 0, 0, 0.00, '<h1>Precision, Timing, and Perfect Shots</h1><p><br /></p><p>Shooty Clock – Unity Game Source Code is a minimalistic arcade shooter where players test their precision, timing, and reflexes!</p><p>Shoot rotating clock tiles, hit targets at the perfect angle, and survive as long as you can!</p><p>Built using Unity 6, this addictive one-tap game is ideal for developers who want a simple, elegant, and challenging mobile project ready to publish.</p><p>The gameplay is easy to understand within seconds, but mastering the timing and accuracy required to achieve high scores creates a rewarding challenge that keeps players engaged.</p><p><br /></p><h2>🎬 Watch Gameplay Video</h2><p><br /></p><p>Watch on YouTube:</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ifal4YvGROg\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ifal4YvGROg</a></p><p><br /></p><h2>A Game of Perfect Timing</h2><p><br /></p><p>Every shot matters. Players must carefully observe the movement of rotating clock tiles and release their shots at exactly the right moment.</p><p>As the game progresses, increasing speed and more challenging patterns demand greater focus, quicker reactions, and improved precision.</p><p><br /></p><h2>Included Gameplay Features</h2><p><br /></p><ul><li>Addictive One-Tap Gameplay – Tap to shoot at the perfect time.</li><li>Fast Reflex Challenge – Hit moving clock tiles before they block your path.</li><li>Minimal Design – Clean and modern UI with smooth animations.</li><li>Increasing Difficulty – Test your accuracy as speed ramps up.</li><li>Crisp Sound FX – Engaging click, shoot, and success sounds.</li><li>Mobile Optimized – Lightweight and smooth for all Android/iOS devices.</li><li>Score & Timer System – Beat your own records and stay focused.</li><li><br /></li></ul><h2>Built Around Simplicity</h2><p><br /></p><p>Hyper-casual games succeed through simple mechanics and strong replay value. Shooty Clock focuses on a single core concept and turns it into an engaging skill-based experience that encourages players to improve with every attempt.</p><p>The project can easily be adapted with new visual themes, target designs, effects, and progression systems while preserving the original gameplay loop.</p><p><br /></p><h2>Project Advantages</h2><p><br /></p><ul><li>100% complete Unity project</li><li>Easy to reskin & customize</li><li>Lightweight and addictive gameplay</li><li>Perfect for hyper-casual game publishers</li><li>AdMob/Unity Ads ready</li><li>Ideal for tap timing or reflex game categories</li></ul><p><br /></p><h2>Included Assets</h2><p><br /></p><ul><li>Full Unity Project Folder</li><li>Complete C# Source Code</li><li>UI & Game Assets</li><li>Documentation & Setup Guide</li><li>Developer Support</li></ul><p><br /></p><h2>Requirements</h2><p><br /></p><ul><li>Unity 6 or newer</li><li>Android/iOS SDK</li><li>Basic Unity Knowledge</li></ul><p><br /></p><h2>Customization and Publishing</h2><p><br /></p><p>Open the project in Unity and review the included gameplay systems, UI assets, and visual effects.</p><p>Replace icons, name, and colors to match your branding requirements. AdMob integration can also be added before release if monetization is planned.</p><p>After testing, export the build for Android or iOS and publish it on the Play Store or App Store.</p><p><br /></p><h2>Contact & Support 📞</h2><h3><br /></h3><h3>WhatsApp: +91 9408212310</h3><h3>Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@read