(124, 1, 1, 1, 5, 'Water Sort Puzzle Unity Source Code', NULL, 'Water Sort Unity Game Source Code – A relaxing color sorting puzzle game with smooth gameplay, challenging levels, vibrant graphics, and mobile-ready optimization. Perfect for Play Store and App Store publishing', 'water-sort-puzzle-unity-source-code', 15.00000000, 59.00000000, 120.00000000, '6a351c0b5725c1781865483.jpg', 1, 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ELXIc_ZqJRSIunptnmF5NVe6o6vLbM4H/view?usp=sharing', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q60_n3ApxQM', '[]', '6a351c0b5a12a1781865483.jpg', '6a351c0b768be1781865483.jpg', 0, 0, 0.00, '<h1>A Relaxing Puzzle Experience Built Around Colors and Logic 🎨</h1><p><br /></p><p>xWater Sort – Unity Game Source Code is a color-sorting puzzle game where players must pour liquids between bottles to organize them by color.</p><p>It’s relaxing, addictive, and mentally stimulating — perfect for players of all ages.</p><p>Built with Unity 6, this project includes smooth animations, level progression, and a calm design that appeals to casual gamers worldwide.</p><p>The gameplay combines simple interactions with strategic thinking, creating a satisfying puzzle experience that encourages players to plan their moves carefully while enjoying a stress-free atmosphere. 🧩</p><p><br /></p><h2>🎬 Watch Gameplay Video</h2><p><br /></p><p>Watch on YouTube:</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q60_n3ApxQM\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q60_n3ApxQM</a></p><p><br /></p><h2>Easy to Learn, Rewarding to Master</h2><p><br /></p><p>The objective is straightforward: organize the liquids so that each bottle contains only a single color. While early levels introduce the mechanics gradually, later stages require more planning and logical thinking.</p><p>This balance between accessibility and challenge makes the game appealing to both casual players and puzzle enthusiasts.</p><p><br /></p><h2>Main Gameplay Elements</h2><p><br /></p><ul><li>🧠 Mind-Challenging Levels – Sort liquids ca